#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rst:2
msgid "rms"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:1
msgid ""
"Returns the root mean square of each row of the input tensor in the given"
" dimension ``dim``.  If ``dim`` is a list of dimensions, reduce over all "
"of them."
msgstr ""
"指定された次元 ``dim`` において、入力テンソルの各行の二乗平均平方根を返します。``dim`` "
"が次元のリストである場合、すべての次元にわたって集約します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:5
msgid "The root mean square (RMS) is defined as:"
msgstr "二乗平均平方根（RMS）は次のように定義されます:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:7
msgid ""
"\\text{RMS}(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i^2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{RMS}(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i^2}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:10
msgid ""
"It measures the magnitude of values regardless of their signs, and is "
"commonly used to quantify the size of signals or returns."
msgstr "これは符号によらず値の大きさを測るもので、シグナルやリターンの大きさを定量化するためによく用いられます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:14
msgid "The input tensor."
msgstr "入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:17
msgid ""
"The dimension or dimensions to reduce. If ``None`` (default), reduces "
"over all dimensions."
msgstr "縮約する次元（複数可）。``None``\\ （デフォルト）の場合、すべての次元にわたって縮約します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:21
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has ``dim`` retained or not. Default is "
"``False``."
msgstr "出力テンソルが ``dim`` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは ``False`` です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Returns"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:25
msgid "The root mean square of the input tensor over the specified dimensions."
msgstr "指定された次元にわたる入力テンソルの二乗平均平方根。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:30
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:32
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, -2.0, 3.0, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.rms(x)\n"
"tensor(2.7386)"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, -2.0, 3.0, -4.0])\n"
">>> QF.rms(x)\n"
"tensor(2.7386)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:36
msgid ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -2.0], [3.0, -4.0]])\n"
">>> QF.rms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1.5811, 3.5355])"
msgstr ""
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, -2.0], [3.0, -4.0]])\n"
">>> QF.rms(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([1.5811, 3.5355])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.rms.rms:40
msgid "``torch.std``: Standard deviation (RMS of deviations from the mean)."
msgstr "``torch.std``: 標準偏差（平均からの偏差の RMS）。"

#~ msgid "The output tensor."
#~ msgstr "出力テンソル。"

